  "Concerto of Time": "",
  "Deal Wind damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK.\\nThen, open [Summer Starscape], permanently increase Ayaka's DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>, and restore $3 HIGHLIGHT Energy.\\nAfter opening [Summer Starscape], Ayaka cannot use this skill.\\n[Summer Starscape]: Before the end of Ayaka's turn, deal Wind damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK. This damage is counted as a Follow Up.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Several twinkling stars spiral upward, and brilliant fireworks burst forth in unison the moment they reach their peak, dealing Wind damage to foes.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Wind damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Ayaka gains [Improvised Song] for $2 turns.\\n[Improvised Song]: At the end of Ayaka's turn, restore $3 bonus HIGHLIGHT Energy.\\nAfter using [Unfinished Song] for the first time, immediately activate [Improvised Song]'s HIGHLIGHT Energy recovery effect.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The music starts, lively notes leap continuously from the speakers, transforming into a brilliant wave of sound that crashes down upon foes.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Wind damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK ($1 hits). If [Summer Starscape] is open, spend all [Star Wish] stacks, and for each stack spent, activate 1 [Summer Starscape]. If Ayaka spent $3 [Star Wish] stacks, additionally increase [Summer Starscape]'s <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $4.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Waving the composing pen, an agile melody drifts toward foes. Wherever the tune reaches, sound blossoms forth, unleashing a breathtaking cascade of resplendent impact.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Gain $1 [Star Wish] stack, then increase [Summer Starscape]'s Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color>. Lasts for $3 turn.\\nAfter spending $4 HIGHLIGHT Energy, each subsequent $5 HIGHLIGHT Energy spent will grant $6 bonus [Star Wish] stack. Then further increase [Summer Starscape]'s Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$7</color>.\\nThe Crit DMG buff from repeated HIGHLIGHT activation does not stack.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Wind damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
